Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:09.00,overtake - staff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}本字幕由悠哈璃羽字幕社製作，僅用於日語交流使用\N請勿私自二次上傳及用作商業用途
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:17.00,overtake - staff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}翻譯＆校對：cz@阿羅拖拉機  時後：萌新時刻準備擺爛
Comment: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:21.34,overtake op jp - 01,,0,0,0,template line,{\fad(200,200)}
Comment: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:21.34,overtake op cn - 01,,0,0,0,template line,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.02,0:00:51.69,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,喝咖啡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.81,0:00:55.14,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不喝  你覺得是因為誰才遲到的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.37,0:00:57.62,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我都去你家接你了  還一直不肯起床
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:01:00.42,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,都是因為精修圖的交稿期啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.89,0:01:03.72,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,光是準備器材就累壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.62,0:01:10.36,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:13.50,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說決賽氛圍比較劍拔弩張
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.17,0:01:16.55,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就得把圍場內的事情處理好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:18.83,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道啦  小冴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.11,0:01:19.85,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,你的稱呼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:23.17,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,你記得要叫我雪平小姐  至少得叫我冴子才行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.51,0:01:25.15,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,每次給你分配工作都被人說
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.41,0:01:28.13,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,「你還惦記著他呢  小冴」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.43,0:01:31.16,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個死脂肪肝局長每次都囉囉嗦嗦的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.53,0:01:35.37,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,你的心聲都說出口了哦  雪平總編
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.00,0:01:38.45,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,資料你都看過沒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.89,0:01:39.57,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,現在看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.11,0:01:42.02,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.93,0:01:46.59,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,Super GT？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.18,0:01:50.11,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  下個月要出一期特輯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:01:54.85,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,最近很多女孩子喜歡賽車運動呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:01:58.06,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,是覺得拼上性命駕駛很帥氣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.59,0:02:02.67,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,那這週末就拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.65,0:02:04.77,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,反正你也有空吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.22,0:02:07.28,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,日薪我會給你算高一點的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.38,0:02:12.68,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,不…別看我這樣  我還是挺忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.76,0:02:15.61,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我說你啊  今天的模特攝影呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.07,0:02:18.79,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天突然很想拍物體啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.01,0:02:21.26,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,所以拜託他們交換了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.46,0:02:24.76,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,你還好意思交換  這可是我專門給你安排的工作啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.82,0:02:29.42,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,隨便你了  總之就拜託了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.27,0:02:31.12,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.29,0:02:50.17,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.69,0:02:57.94,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs60}富士國際賽車場
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.18,0:03:03.28,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,那我停好車後去跟他們的公關打聲招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.97,0:03:06.74,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,你拍攝之前記得去接待處拿一下工作服
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.32,0:03:08.15,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,工作服？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.46,0:03:10.83,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,是件背心  媒體穿的是粉色
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:13.64,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,小冴…冴子小姐你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.89,0:03:16.80,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你睡過頭了  車子只能停到遠處的停車場了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.11,0:03:17.79,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.17,0:03:18.93,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.40,0:03:28.07,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,小孝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.25,0:03:33.75,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要求你時刻都這樣  但是偶爾也得…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.43,0:03:36.30,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.99,0:03:37.86,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,你的稱呼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.46,0:03:41.04,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,不是小孝  應該是孝哉才對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.90,0:04:00.17,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,該怎麼努力…我早就忘得一乾二淨了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.82,0:04:53.69,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,這次排位賽您感覺狀態如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.07,0:04:56.69,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我想想  賽車的機械狀態還不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.99,0:05:00.04,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,應該能跑出令自己滿意的成績吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.95,0:05:14.94,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,希望接下來的比賽也能延續這種狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.10,0:06:04.77,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,好多賽車
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.55,0:06:08.78,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,好多輪胎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.50,0:06:11.72,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,F1？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:12.97,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,借過一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.14,0:06:17.43,overtake - note,NTP,0,0,0,,註：哼的是教父主題曲「The Godfather」後續的玩笑也是教父裡的經典場景
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:26.02,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,錮太  丟死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.33,0:06:29.23,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼啦  悠  這調調多振奮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.73,0:06:34.05,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,趕緊都讓開  不然第二天早上就會發現床上有馬頭的屍體哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.26,0:06:39.33,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼情況
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.58,0:06:43.04,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,真賀？你是真賀孝哉嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.53,0:06:45.50,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,笑生先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.77,0:06:46.86,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:49.08,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,久疏問候了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.73,0:06:52.31,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不見  今天是來工作嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.59,0:06:55.54,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  是Super GT攝影相關的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:07:00.97,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,真賀你之前拍的咱們辦公室的照片  大家評價很好哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.31,0:07:03.34,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望採訪照片也交給你來拍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.77,0:07:06.31,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,不…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:09.81,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,話說回來  笑生先生怎麼來這裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.79,0:07:11.69,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒跟你說過嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.27,0:07:15.34,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我現在是這支車隊的老闆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.76,0:07:19.35,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,老闆是…F1的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.45,0:07:24.53,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,不是F1  這裡停著的車都是F4
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.90,0:07:26.85,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,1234的4
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.11,0:07:29.21,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,F4…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.41,0:07:32.20,overtake - note,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(903,943.333)}Formula 4
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.41,0:07:32.20,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,F4  四級方程式
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.70,0:07:34.72,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,和F1是不同級別的賽車
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.31,0:07:39.05,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,在這裡是Super GT的墊賽  也就是暖場賽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.61,0:07:41.73,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,這場比賽比的就是F4
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:45.54,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是我的車隊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.97,0:07:48.29,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,Belsorriso
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:54.18,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,真厲害  賽車都閃閃發光的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:58.29,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,不好好拋光保養的話  車身上出現小劃痕的時候就看不出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.13,0:08:00.31,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,早月
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.07,0:08:03.93,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,早月  今天也要加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.17,0:08:05.71,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我會在大看台上注視你的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.23,0:08:08.14,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,感謝你們一直以來的加油
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:12.02,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我也會為了大家加油的哦  小貓咪們
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:16.42,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,好帥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.50,0:08:18.87,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,早月
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.22,0:08:22.79,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  無關人士不能進入帳篷內…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.25,0:08:24.78,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啦  看看又沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.99,0:08:25.97,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,就是就是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.20,0:08:30.01,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺像搖滾明星一樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.90,0:08:32.06,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我們的車手
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:35.11,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我來介紹吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.65,0:08:37.72,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,這是一直關照我們的真賀孝哉先生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:38.59,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:41.23,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我們的一號車手春永早月
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.99,0:08:44.52,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,以及二號車手德丸俊軌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:46.09,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我們的兩名王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:46.86,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.19,0:08:47.91,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,初次見面
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.76,0:08:49.93,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,你是攝影師嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:54.70,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,是攝像師  我主要負責拍照片
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.98,0:09:00.66,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,那請務必拍下我今天登上頒獎台的英姿哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:03.73,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  春永
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.06,0:09:06.02,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,亞梨子也要好好看著哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:10.09,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,真抱歉  雖然是個胡鬧的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.41,0:09:11.64,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是他駕駛技術不壞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:15.48,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是讓他以F3或是F2為目標來培養的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.74,0:09:19.40,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺真厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.92,0:09:21.56,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.40,0:09:23.12,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,德丸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.05,0:09:26.56,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,麻煩你帶真賀逛逛F4的圍場吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:31.50,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,真不好意思  你馬上就要開始比賽了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:32.88,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,不耽誤你準備比賽嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.60,0:09:36.71,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事  我只要按指令跑就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.22,0:09:41.46,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,你是來拍Super GT的照片的吧  你很熟悉這方面的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.81,0:09:44.23,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,不…其實我完全不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.47,0:09:48.54,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,又有輪胎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.24,0:09:51.73,overtake - note,NTP,0,0,0,,註：賽車用的熱熔胎是通過熔化輪胎形成凝膠狀獲取抓地力，所以需要先升溫至工作溫度。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.24,0:09:51.73,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,他們在給輪胎升溫  為了提升抓地力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.36,0:09:53.35,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是日光浴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:55.90,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,你真博學
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.64,0:09:58.81,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,話說回來  人還真多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.23,0:10:02.05,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,今年總共有20支車隊共計36名車手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.94,0:10:05.17,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟F4的門檻比較低嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:09.61,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,只需要國內A級賽照  國際B級及以下賽照
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:12.76,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,或是國內限定A級賽照
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.62,0:10:16.32,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是…駕照之類的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.71,0:10:20.55,overtake - note,NTP,0,0,0,,註：此處沒有解釋，但是駕照和賽照分類不同不能混為一談
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.71,0:10:20.55,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,也有一些其他的條件  但最關鍵的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:22.31,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,還是錢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.37,0:10:24.48,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,錢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.78,0:10:29.32,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  畢竟各類維護和賽車整備都需要花錢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.37,0:10:33.66,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,技術和金錢都是必須具備的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.34,0:10:38.67,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,技術只要練習就能掌握個大概  但這也是需要花錢的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.47,0:10:43.86,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,所以既有投入大把金錢  以晉級F3F2  甚至是F1為目標
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:45.84,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,這一類十分重視速度的車隊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.32,0:10:51.42,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,也有捨得花錢  但主要是為了享受駕駛樂趣本身的私人車隊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:53.30,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是興趣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:55.41,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,車手是公司社長
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.00,0:10:58.19,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,他的夢想是在比賽上駕駛賽車
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.33,0:11:02.37,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:05.17,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,還真有各種各樣的參加者呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.63,0:11:06.75,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.75,0:11:11.61,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是最厲害的  是那種既沒錢又沒技術
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.91,0:11:13.82,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,完全就是移動路障一樣的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.91,0:11:13.82,overtake - note,NTP,0,0,0,,註：此處的chicanes原意是指S彎，賽車比賽中也指路障
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.72,0:11:15.62,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,路障？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:17.38,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是障礙物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:22.11,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,柯里昂家族…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.02,0:11:24.84,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？是你認識的人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.21,0:11:28.21,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  喂喂喂喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.76,0:11:32.79,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,每次開始比賽前都來找茬  你到底是有多閒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.14,0:11:37.12,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,總比你老是在這整備這一坨垃圾賽車來得好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.64,0:11:39.59,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,你說對吧  路障哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.52,0:11:53.14,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,好嚇人  開始比賽前的緊張感也太嚇人了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.25,0:11:58.16,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  今天別再被套圈擋住路了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.45,0:12:01.49,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是遵照藍旗讓車而已
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.77,0:12:04.52,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,是你自己著急衝過來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.70,0:12:08.62,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,好好好  到此為止到此為止
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.22,0:12:12.39,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上開始比賽了吧  還是別在這爭吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.77,0:12:13.96,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,對嗎  對嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.55,0:12:23.56,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,別再出現了  快撒鹽除除晦氣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.53,0:12:26.64,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,話說您哪位？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.47,0:12:28.20,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,是他朋友嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.35,0:12:31.06,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,不…不過很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.14,0:12:33.16,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.15,0:12:36.68,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:39.70,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,加油  我支持你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.35,0:12:41.08,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.93,0:12:44.42,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要支持
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:45.91,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.01,0:12:48.42,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,一個人也能跑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:55.29,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  我買來午飯了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.34,0:12:57.25,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.34,0:13:05.73,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,小牧Motors？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.43,0:13:09.22,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,這是哪位？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.85,0:13:13.89,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,你朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.34,0:13:27.07,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,下次再努力就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.50,0:13:29.51,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,就當是先放個假吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:33.62,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我是不在意的  但是總編堅持要…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:34.73,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.10,0:13:38.15,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的  事情很快就過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:39.96,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs40\bord0\shad0\c&H543727&\pos(1209.43,478.143)}我可不想被拍成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:39.96,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs40\bord0\shad0\c&H543727&\pos(1282.286,541.715)}給人拍照前是不是該做點什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:39.96,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs40\bord0\shad0\c&H543727&\pos(1192,604.571)}別刊載這種玩意啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:39.96,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs40\bord0\shad0\c&H543727&\pos(1129.43,661)}自我陶醉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:39.96,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs40\bord0\shad0\c&H543727&\pos(1127.144,722.714)}你救了他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.68,0:13:39.92,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.14,0:13:43.21,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,加油  我支持你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.41,0:13:44.56,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要支持
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:48.86,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我一個人也能跑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.77,0:13:57.89,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,也是啊  自己都不懂努力的傢伙憑什麼跟人家說加油
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:07.01,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,小牧太先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:09.38,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  剛才多謝你了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:12.20,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說你安撫了吵起來的他們
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.73,0:14:16.94,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,不不  畢竟會過去帳篷那邊也是因為我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.37,0:14:18.14,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,要吃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.93,0:14:20.00,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.98,0:14:24.61,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,笑生是你的熟人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.12,0:14:28.91,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,對  但我也是今天才知道他還有一支車隊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.47,0:14:30.88,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,被嚇了一跳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:36.26,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,比起Belsorriso  我們這種私人車隊簡直就跟過家家一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.89,0:14:37.73,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.27,0:14:41.05,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,當然我們也在以自己的方式在認真對待比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.32,0:14:45.07,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,特別是這一場狀態特別好  我們在排位賽好好努力過了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.14,0:14:49.08,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,看得出來你很喜歡比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.57,0:14:51.61,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,你是在想「明明沒什麼錢」吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.09,0:14:53.05,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.52,0:14:55.53,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,不過啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:14:58.29,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,這真的很有趣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.43,0:15:05.17,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,不論怎麼努力都不會被大車隊放在眼裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.40,0:15:08.74,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,還有人說我們是移動路障
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.71,0:15:13.97,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是只要踏踏實實地在車子上下功夫  逐步提升名次
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:17.53,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,總有一天我們會贏下比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.17,0:15:21.64,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,那一天  說不定就是今天
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:24.80,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才會努力  才會繼續努力下去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.83,0:15:26.85,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,努力…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.55,0:15:30.64,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  一不小心就說得太認真了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.09,0:15:31.95,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,打擾到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:33.95,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.75,0:15:37.30,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,能讓我也看看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.20,0:15:41.59,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,這是內部通行證
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.04,0:15:43.95,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,這一張是多出來的  你可以拿去用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.45,0:15:46.97,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣你就能進入GT圍場了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:49.35,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,GT圍場？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:52.42,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,就是能讓你暫時  你叫…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.76,0:15:54.84,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫真賀  真賀孝哉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.32,0:15:59.17,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,真賀你就暫時成為我們車隊的一員了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.50,0:16:04.34,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,工作服和相機就留在外面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.72,0:16:07.46,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,一般記者是禁止進入的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.52,0:16:10.78,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎來到F4
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.14,0:16:12.24,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.76,0:16:14.65,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎來到F4！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.81,0:16:37.09,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,這就開始了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.35,0:16:39.08,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,加…加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.67,0:16:43.46,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒開始呢  現在是暖胎圈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.07,0:16:46.42,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,在比賽開始前  先在賽道上跑一圈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:50.25,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,這邊  我帶你看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.35,0:16:53.11,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,錮太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:57.38,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我兒子錮太郎  是我們隊的機械師
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.84,0:16:58.95,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:00.94,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,是那人的大叔朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.75,0:17:06.83,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.77,0:17:11.10,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,他們為什麼要像暴走族那樣走蛇形
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.60,0:17:16.67,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,穿行  讓賽車左右搖擺前進  以此均勻摩擦輪胎進行升溫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.43,0:17:19.11,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,看看頭車
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:22.99,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,杆位是Belsorriso的春永早月
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.66,0:17:25.77,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,第二位是德丸俊軌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.43,0:17:31.84,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我們隊的悠是36名之中的第10名起步  位置還不錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.68,0:17:33.54,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,悠…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.00,0:17:35.82,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  淺雛悠
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.34,0:17:39.18,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,是我們小牧Motors引以為豪的王牌車手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:41.41,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼王牌  明明就只有一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.96,0:17:45.14,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是引以為豪是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.39,0:17:51.38,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,淺雛悠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.98,0:18:16.92,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,紅燈熄滅起步
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.27,0:18:19.89,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,春永早月朝著TGR彎前進
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:22.65,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,德丸俊軌也緊隨其後搶到了好位置
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.54,0:18:37.42,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是Belsorriso  起步得真好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.34,0:18:39.61,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,場上出現了黃旗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:41.90,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.45,0:18:46.61,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,黃旗  是告知車手賽道上出現危險狀況了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.05,0:18:50.57,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,安全車的提示板也出來了  是發生事故了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:52.83,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,是在TGR彎啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.24,0:18:56.67,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎是64號和84號發生了碰撞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:02.78,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有人受傷  我們也沒有被波及
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:09.29,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,為了防止發生事故  比賽暫時會由安全車帶領
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.40,0:19:10.88,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,直到確認賽道已經安全
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.29,0:19:12.86,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,這會成為我們追趕的機會
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.47,0:19:14.29,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,追趕？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.63,0:19:18.89,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,在黃旗期間  車手必須限制車速並且禁止超車
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.55,0:19:22.71,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說  可以一下子縮短與頭車的差距
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.61,0:19:32.56,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,開始了開始了  比賽重新開始
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.64,0:19:39.86,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,阿俊真是的  也太拚命了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.21,0:19:47.65,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,哎喲  第五名之後的四台賽車正在併排進入TGR彎道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.16,0:20:04.42,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,在這場競爭中勝出的是80號  淺雛悠
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.81,0:20:08.02,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,好！看到了嗎  不愧是悠
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.00,0:20:14.47,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,真牛  又超車了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.69,0:20:15.69,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,第四名了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.00,0:20:18.35,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定就是今天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.99,0:20:20.42,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.80,0:20:22.69,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就是那一天！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.61,0:20:24.07,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.60,0:20:27.11,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,等下  是要去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.65,0:20:31.87,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,悠如果要進攻的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.19,0:20:35.32,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定會選擇在下坡急剎縮短車距的時候超車
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.04,0:20:38.01,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這裡  DUNLOP彎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.89,0:20:52.43,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,來了來了來了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.11,0:20:58.88,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.98,0:21:01.32,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要支持
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.21,0:21:03.43,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,一個人也能跑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.31,0:21:08.09,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.01,0:21:13.02,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,努力…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.58,0:21:16.43,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是這個樣子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.96,0:21:19.99,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,加油…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.01,0:21:22.77,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.98,0:21:28.74,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.89,0:21:38.98,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,80號爆胎  衝出賽道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.82,0:21:41.60,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎麼回事！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.70,0:21:43.33,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是壓到了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.98,0:21:47.06,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,排位賽太拚命了  輪胎磨損得太厲害了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.92,0:21:52.09,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.28,0:22:15.22,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,耶  我成功了哦小貓咪們
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.65,0:23:15.33,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我說啊  你怎麼在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.14,0:23:17.09,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我拍到了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.50,0:23:28.01,overtake - title1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1552.286,622.286)}駕駛的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.30,0:23:27.65,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我拍下來了
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.30,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,——OP？——
Comment: 0,0:23:29.47,0:23:36.03,overtake op jp - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,Blowing in the wind… waiting for the time to start…
Comment: 0,0:23:36.03,0:23:42.62,overtake op jp - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,急な雨に遭って　水平線は煙った
Comment: 0,0:23:42.82,0:23:49.17,overtake op jp - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,見果てぬ　夢のかたちも
Comment: 0,0:23:50.95,0:23:57.64,overtake op jp - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,欠けたなにかを　それでも抱く期待を
Comment: 0,0:23:57.80,0:24:03.71,overtake op jp - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,この手に　離さぬままで
Comment: 0,0:24:04.10,0:24:10.60,overtake op jp - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,通り過ぎてく曖昧な毎日も　かけがえのない
Comment: 0,0:24:10.69,0:24:13.55,overtake op jp - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,軌跡だって　もう知ってるから
Comment: 0,0:24:13.55,0:24:20.99,overtake op jp - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,待ち続けるより　手を伸ばせば　そこに未来
Comment: 0,0:24:20.99,0:24:28.36,overtake op jp - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,さあ　どんな今日にさえ　明日が来て　僕ら進んできただろう
Comment: 0,0:24:28.53,0:24:35.96,overtake op jp - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,曇天の日々だって　終わりが来て　青天がのぞくだろう
Comment: 0,0:24:35.96,0:24:43.33,overtake op jp - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,声なき声が今も聞こえている
Comment: 0,0:24:43.51,0:24:51.26,overtake op jp - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,名もなき風が髪を揺らす
Comment: 0,0:23:29.47,0:23:36.03,overtake op cn - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,無論今天如何  明天依舊到來  我們仍會前進
Comment: 0,0:23:36.03,0:23:42.62,overtake op cn - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,突然降下的雨  讓地平線模糊不清
Comment: 0,0:23:42.82,0:23:49.17,overtake op cn - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,一併模糊了那未曾實現的夢想
Comment: 0,0:23:50.95,0:23:57.64,overtake op cn - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,即便缺少了什麼  但也依然抱有期待
Comment: 0,0:23:57.80,0:24:03.71,overtake op cn - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,緊緊抓著這雙手一刻不曾放開
Comment: 0,0:24:04.10,0:24:10.60,overtake op cn - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,共同度過的曖昧每一天  同樣不可缺少
Comment: 0,0:24:10.69,0:24:13.55,overtake op cn - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,往後的軌跡  其實早已知曉
Comment: 0,0:24:13.55,0:24:20.99,overtake op cn - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,與其一直等待  不如伸手去觸及未來
Comment: 0,0:24:20.99,0:24:28.36,overtake op cn - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,無論今天如何  明天依舊到來  我們仍會前進
Comment: 0,0:24:28.53,0:24:35.96,overtake op cn - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,陰翳的日子總會過去  之後便是晴天
Comment: 0,0:24:35.96,0:24:43.33,overtake op cn - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,不曾發出的聲音  如今也已經知曉
Comment: 0,0:24:43.51,0:24:51.26,overtake op cn - 01,,0,0,0,karaoke,那沒有名字的風  吹動著你的頭髮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.85,0:25:00.73,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.11,0:25:03.69,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,請讓我成為你們隊伍的贊助！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.14,0:25:06.80,overtake - text,NTP,0,0,0,,我想為你們加油！
